"ks":1,"ref":"Al-A‘rāf 7:85-86","a":86,"u":"ٱلۡمُفۡسِدِينَ"}],"nl":"O mijn volk, aanbid Allah; jullie hebben geen andere god dan Hem. Er is een duidelijk bewijs van jullie Heer tot jullie gekomen. Geef dus de volle maat en het volle gewicht, doe de mensen niet tekort in hun spullen en zaai geen verderf op aarde nadat zij in orde is gebracht. Dat is beter voor jullie, als jullie gelovigen zijn. En ga niet op elke weg zitten om te dreigen en om wie in Hem gelooft van de weg van Allah af te houden, terwijl jullie die weg krom willen maken. Gedenk dat jullie met weinigen waren en dat Hij jullie talrijk maakte. En kijk hoe het afliep met de verderfzaaiers.","eind":".","koran":true}],"lijst":{"ism":["_ha","_hu","_hum","_kum","ab","allah","aqiba","ard","bad_z","bayyina","dhalika","ghayr","hakim","hum","idh","ilah","islah","iwaj","kayfa","kayl","khayr","khitab","kull","maa","man_i","mizan","muallim","mufsid","mumin","nas","nasiha","qalil","qawm","rabb","rahim_q","sabil","shan","shay","sirat"],"fil":["abad","afsad","amana","awad","awfa","bagha","bakhas","dhakar","jaaa","kan","kaththar","nawwa","nazar","qaad","qal","sadd_v","tafannan"],"harf":["al","an","bi","fa","fi","in_s","la","li","min","qad","wa","ya"]},"boek":"qasas"}